{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based Chaos. Competitive Mayhem. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bounce, dash, and smash your way through the arena in <strong>Wobble Wars</strong> \u2013 a chaotic, physics-driven multiplayer game where spherical characters battle for dominance in outrageous environments. Whether you're outwitting foes in tactical objective modes or throwing your wobbly weight around in pure madness, this is the most fun you\u2019ve ever had as a rolling ball. <br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Use momentum, ricochets, and dashes to knock opponents off the map or into traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Movement</strong> \u2013 Master spin boosts, bounce timing, wall bounces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 10 players online or with friends via local split-screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to sweat in ranked matches or just laugh with friends in casual mode, <strong>Wobble Wars</strong> brings the energy, absurdity, and depth you didn't know you needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Capture the Flag, One Flag, Races, King of the Hill, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New maps, seasonal content, and rotating events keep the chaos fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock hundreds of skins, trails, flags, emotes, and taunts to show off your wobble style.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682170?t=1757961609","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682170?t=1757961609","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682170/251a48fb9712205634093fa1d8a0d58797fd4488/capsule_231