os fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock hundreds of skins, trails, flags, emotes, and taunts to show off your wobble style.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Hito Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682170/a643096ab843da3b685be1f619eed01ddf486d84/header.jpg?t=1757961609","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Default one would do</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3682170/2076055919/bf7f7f847a9a18131e9900db0a5e310c9aff182a/1757958347/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757961607","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3682170/2076055919/bf7f7f847a9a18131e9900db0a5e310c9aff182a/1757958347/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757961607","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3682170/2076055919/bf7f7f847a9a18131e9900db0a5e310c9aff182a/1757958347/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757961607","id":257198221,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198221/movie480.mp4?t=1757961607","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198221/movie_max.mp4?t=1757961607"},"name":"Cinematic Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps